{
  "purpose": "UG-G2-SB6 §6 第 3 項「逐月對號」這項檢查的 **known-FAIL 案例**（`CLAUDE.md` §9A.2）。**證明它有失敗能力，不是一個永遠通過的檢查。**",
  "date": "2026-09-03",
  "evidence_label": "`VERIFIED THIS SESSION`（PM 執行；且**本檔本身離線可重現**，見 `HOW_TO_REPRODUCE`）",
  "WHY_THIS_FILE_EXISTS": "本 known-FAIL 原本只寫在 `G2_SB6_GATE_B_SUBMISSION.md` §8 的表格裡，**八筆只列了三筆、第四欄不是可重跑指令、且沒有任何證據檔記錄那次執行**。複查方 2026-09-03 指出：\n> **一份證明「其他檢查會失敗」的證據，自己不可重跑。**\n**這與本 SB 一路在抓的形狀完全相同，只是這一次落在最上層。**",
  "WHAT_IS_BEING_TESTED": "被測的檢查是 **§6 第 3 項**：管線寫進 `universe_snapshots` 的逐月候選數，必須逐一等於校準基準。\n**問題**：這個檢查有沒有可能是結構上無法失敗的？\n**答法**：拿一個**已知錯誤**的基準去比對同一份管線輸出。若檢查有失敗能力，它必須 FAIL。",
  "THE_TWO_BASELINES": {
    "inclusive": {
      "name": "含當日窗（**已作廢**）",
      "window": "`c.rk BETWEEN e.rk - 59 AND e.rk` —— 60 個交易日，**含 `effective_date` 當天**",
      "origin": "`G2_SB6_union_count_calibration_4y.json` 使用的窗口定義。⚠ **該檔只有分市場的 twse／tpex 兩欄，沒有 `union_all`** —— 本檔補上，故本檔是含當日 `union_all` 的**唯一版控紀錄**。",
      "why_wrong": "違反 DEC-017（`APPROVED`）「只能使用**生效日前已知**的 60 交易日成交資料」與提案 §5 的 P1 `max(trade_date) < effective_date`。見 DEC-033。"
    },
    "exclusive": {
      "name": "排他窗（**現行**）",
      "window": "`c.rk BETWEEN e.rk - 60 AND e.rk - 1` —— 60 個交易日，**嚴格早於 `effective_date`**",
      "origin": "`G2_SB6_union_count_calibration_pit.json` 的 `baseline[].union_all`"
    }
  },
  "sql_verbatim": {
    "inclusive": "WITH cal AS (\n  SELECT trade_date d, row_number() OVER (ORDER BY trade_date)::int rk\n  FROM (SELECT DISTINCT trade_date FROM candidate_prices) x),\neff AS (\n  SELECT c.rk, c.d FROM cal c\n  JOIN (SELECT min(d) md FROM cal GROUP BY date_trunc('month', d)) m ON m.md = c.d\n  WHERE c.rk >= 61)\nSELECT e.d,\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id) FILTER (WHERE cp.source = 'twse_mi_index'),\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id) FILTER (WHERE cp.source = 'tpex_daily_quotes'),\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id)\nFROM eff e\nJOIN cal c ON c.rk BETWEEN e.rk - 59 AND e.rk\nJOIN candidate_prices cp ON cp.trade_date = c.d\nGROUP BY e.d ORDER BY e.d;",
    "exclusive": "WITH cal AS (\n  SELECT trade_date d, row_number() OVER (ORDER BY trade_date)::int rk\n  FROM (SELECT DISTINCT trade_date FROM candidate_prices) x),\neff AS (\n  SELECT c.rk, c.d FROM cal c\n  JOIN (SELECT min(d) md FROM cal GROUP BY date_trunc('month', d)) m ON m.md = c.d\n  WHERE c.rk >= 61)\nSELECT e.d,\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id) FILTER (WHERE cp.source = 'twse_mi_index'),\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id) FILTER (WHERE cp.source = 'tpex_daily_quotes'),\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id)\nFROM eff e\nJOIN cal c ON c.rk BETWEEN e.rk - 60 AND e.rk - 1\nJOIN candidate_prices cp ON cp.trade_date = c.d\nGROUP BY e.d ORDER BY e.d;",
    "pipeline": "-- 管線自己的路徑：從它實際寫入的列去數，**不重跑上面任何一句**\nSELECT effective_date, count(*) AS union_all\nFROM universe_snapshots GROUP BY effective_date ORDER BY effective_date;"
  },
